    {
      "source": "Represents a function that executes a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Statement</code></a> for a (delayed)\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Result.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Result</code></a> stream.",
